# What the deployed site does NOT carry.
#
# Wrangler uploads wrangler.jsonc's assets.directory minus these entries, using
# .gitignore syntax. _headers is consumed by the platform rather than served.
#
# The site carries the page and the evidence the page cites — the two
# measurement documents, the constants they derive from, the corpus manifest,
# and the CC0 samples. That set is not decoration: the footer links to it, and
# a reproducibility claim whose links 404 is worse than no claim. The licences
# travel with it because the site is what distributes those measurements.
#
# What stays behind is this repository's internal notes, the harness, and the
# tests. Those make the numbers checkable in the repository, which is where
# checking them belongs.
#
# ⚠️ Three rules this file must keep, all enforced by tools/check-site.mjs:
#
#  1. Every rule is anchored with a leading slash. An unanchored .gitignore
#     rule matches at every depth — `data/` would also hide `assets/data/`,
#     where the page reads its density figures. Wrangler reports nothing for
#     that; the deploy succeeds and the page 404s at runtime.
#  2. No globs and no `!` negation. The checker computes the served set exactly
#     from these rules, and it can only do that while they stay literal.
#  3. Every top-level entry is either listed here or explicitly allowed to
#     ship, so a new directory cannot join the upload unnoticed.
#
# Measured against workerd, 2026-09-02.

# ── project paperwork: for whoever works on the repository, not for a visitor.
#    docs/ is the exception that needs watching — the two measurement documents
#    ship, everything else there must be listed here. check-site.mjs fails on a
#    served docs/ file that nothing links to, so a new one cannot ride along.
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
/CONTRIBUTING.md
/README.md
/docs/BRIEF.md
/docs/screenshots/

# ── the harness: it proves the numbers, it is not one of them
/tests/
/tools/

# ── TED2020 archives. CC BY-NC-ND: we pin their checksums, we do not
#    redistribute them (corpus/README.md §2). Also 85MB.
/corpus/cache/

# ── repository and deploy plumbing
/.claude/
/.git/
/.github/
/.gitignore
/.assetsignore
/.wrangler/
/wrangler.jsonc
